    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230540/extras/ff02c79bd6a2b41fe45514e0d1fd5b90.poster.avif?t=1740005200\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230540/extras/ff02c79bd6a2b41fe45514e0d1fd5b90.webm?t=1740005200\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOW AVAILABLE ON KICKSTARTER! DO YOU SUPPORT ME?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cronela's Mansion is a Point and click adventure inspired by the LucasArts and Sierra games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The PC version will have unique and innovative mechanics such as &quot;sneak&quot;, &quot;Scare&quot;, &quot;play dead&quot;, in addition to the 9 traditional adventure verbs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Cronela's Mansion will be available for retro consoles! You can follow us on our social networks to know more about this.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NES VERSION</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230540/extras/c875089cb7a049a9b604d61ae676f9e9.avif?t=1740005200\" data-has-big width=800 height=656 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GBA VERSION</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230540/extras/5e0ea268509521eadad132a8307a1f8d.avif?t=1740005200\" data-has-big width=800 height=532 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GB VERSION</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230540/extras/64f1856ff1a855faf23a61e8c7b513b5.avif?t=1740005200\" data-has-big width=800 height=716 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All retro editions will have physical editions! Follow me on <u>KICKSTARTER</u> so you don't miss the launch!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230540/extras/5ffc4620fcbabfd210717f0bb931a77b.avif?t=1740005200\" data-has-big width=800 height=490 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NES AND PC BIG BOX,\u00a0GB, GBA AND SNES VERSIONS ALSO AVAILABLE!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230540/extras/da1313300b1b7fab4a7a57158ca22433.avif?t=1740005200\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Cronela\u00b4s Mansion awaits you more manic than ever!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230540/extras/ff02c79bd6a2b41fe45514e0d1fd5b90.poster.avif?t=1740005200\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230540/extras/ff02c79bd6a2b41fe45514e0d1fd5b90.webm?t=1740005200\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOW AVAILABLE ON KICKSTARTER! DO YOU SUPPORT ME?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cronela's Mansion is a Point and click adventure inspired by the LucasArts and Sierra games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The PC version will have unique and innovative mechanics such as &quot;sneak&quot;, &quot;Scare&quot;, &quot;play dead&quot;, in addition to the 9 traditional adventure verbs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Cronela's Mansion will be available for retro consoles! You can follow us on our social networks to know more about this.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NES VERSION</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230540/extras/c875089cb7a049a9b604d61ae676f9e9.avif?t=1740005200\" data-has-big width=800 height=656 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GBA VERSION</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230540/extras/5e0ea268509521eadad132a8307a1f8d.avif?t=1740005200\" data-has-big width=800 height=532 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GB VERSION</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230540/extras/64f1856ff1a855faf23a61e8c7b513b5.avif?t=1740005200\" data-has-big width=800 height=716 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All retro editions will have physical editions! Follow me on <u>KICKSTARTER</u> so you don't miss the launch!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230540/extras/5ffc4620fcbabfd210717f0bb931a77b.avif?t=1740005200\" data-has-big width=800 height=490 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NES AND PC BIG BOX,\u00a0GB, GBA AND SNES VERSIONS ALSO AVAILABLE!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230540/extras/da1313300b1b7fab4a7a57158ca22433.avif?t=1740005200\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Cronela\u00b4s Mansion awaits you more manic than ever!</p>",
